@DH App is the designated digital front door of the Department of Health. It serves as a quick channel for Healthcare Professionals, Institutions & Schools, Business & Workplace and General Public to access the Department’s information.
 
@DH App allows you to easily access various e-Services and e-Resources, such as quit smoking services, electronic application forms, public health advice and publications. Various videos and infographics are also presented to promote public health awareness.
 
You can now check upcoming events offered by the Department through @DH App, and seamlessly integrate these information in the calendar of your mobile device, helping you prioritise your health activities.
 
There are exclusive collection of Lazy Lion WhatsApp stickers only from @DH App.  You can now share stickers with friends and family.
 
What’s more, you can receive instant in-app notifications on public health, and any updates on events that you are interested in.
